Pasti semangat ya. Iya enggak sih?
You're excited, right? Isn't that so?

180
00:15:05,717 --> 00:15:10,217
Lihat para si ada adrenalin rasakannya. Pengen lari aku rasanya nih.
Look, everyone feels the adrenaline rush. I feel like running!

181
00:15:10,217 --> 00:15:12,417
Wait, wait, wait... Mau ke mana?
Wait, wait, wait... Where are you going?

182
00:15:12,417 --> 00:15:18,617
Mau ke mana? Stop stop stop stop!
Where are you going? Stop, stop, stop, stop!

183
00:15:18,617 --> 00:15:21,617
Nanti keringetan loh. Ah, Kaela gimana?
You'll get sweaty, you know! So, Kaela, how do you feel?

184
00:15:22,617 --> 00:15:27,617
Aduh, seru banget! Aku enggak nyangka sih, sampe aku bisa ada di sini ya.
Oh, it's so exciting! I never expected to be standing here.

185
00:15:27,617 --> 00:15:32,617
Tapi ini ngomong-ngomong konsernya masih panjang banget, jadi kalian tetap semangat ya sampai akhir!
But anyway, this concert is still long, so stay hyped until the end!

186
00:15:32,617 --> 00:15:37,617
Semangat! Semangat banget!
Yeah! Stay hyped! Keep your spirits up!

187
00:15:37,617 --> 00:15:43,117
Eh, tapi ngomongin konser dari tadi, emang pada tahu judul konsernya apa?
Hey, speaking of the concert, does everyone know the title of the concert?

188
00:15:43,117 --> 00:15:47,817
Judul konser kita kali ini adalah Chromatic Future!
Our concert title this time is "Chromatic Future"!

189
00:15:47,817 --> 00:15:50,917
Ada yang tahu enggak artinya apa? Ayo absen!
Does anyone know what it means? Come on, tell us!

190
00:15:50,917 --> 00:15:53,717
Nah ini, Kobo paling tahu.
Here, Kobo knows it best.

191
00:15:53,717 --> 00:16:00,817
Yang jelasin yang paling tinggi! Ya, Kaela!
Let the tallest one explain it! Yes, Kaela, go!

192
00:16:00,817 --> 00:16:03,817
Gak gitu ya! Ya udah lah. Ya udah, ya udah. Nih ya guys ya...
It's not like that! Alright then. Okay, guys...

193
00:16:03,817 --> 00:16:09,717
buat kalian yang belum tahu, Chromatic Future itu artinya tuh masa depan yang berwarna-warni.
for those who don't know, Chromatic Future means a colorful future.

194
00:16:09,717 --> 00:16:17,817
Jadi karena hololive Indonesia kan udah 5 tahun nih, kita sama-sama dari hari 1 sampai sekarang.
Since hololive Indonesia has been around for 5 years, we've been together from Day 1 until now.

195
00:16:17,817 --> 00:16:26,817
Nah, jadi tuh untuk kedepannya kita tuh juga harapannya tuh kita bisa nyiptain waktu dan memori yang berwarna-warni sama seluruh fans dari hololive Indonesia!
So going forward, we hope to create colorful time and memories together with all hololive Indonesia fans!

196
00:16:26,817 --> 00:16:33,617
Iya gitu! Betul! Kaela Kovalskia! Cerdas cerdas betul betul!
That's right! Exactly! Kaela Kovalskia is so smart! Exactly!

197
00:16:33,617 --> 00:16:38,917
Nah, kalian sekarang udah pada tahu kan? Karena tadi udah dijelasin sama Kaela.
So now you all know, right? Since Kaela just explained it.

198
00:16:38,917 --> 00:16:46,617
Kalau gitu, konsernya kan udah mulai nih. Kalian mau ngepost soal konser ini di medsos,
Since the concert has started, if you want to post about this concert on social media,

199
00:16:46,617 --> 00:16:51,817
jangan lupa hashtag #idChromaticFuture ya!
don't forget to use the hashtag #idChromaticFuture, okay?

200
00:16:51,817 --> 00:16:58,817
Karena kita pengen banget lihat kalian tuh... pengen lihat semangat kalian!
Because we really want to see your excitement!

201
00:16:58,817 --> 00:17:04,617
Ya, itu! Betul banget, ya enggak? Jangan typo! Jangan typo!
Yes, exactly! That's right! Don't make typos! Don't make typos!

202
00:17:04,617 --> 00:17:08,717
Asik, share ke semua, oke?
Nice! Share it to everyone, okay?

203
00:17:08,717 --> 00:17:18,617
Jadi... tapi jujur deh, kalian tuh pas dibilang kita bakal konser loh di Indonesia, kalian pada kaget enggak sih?
So... but honestly, were you guys surprised when you were told we'd have a concert in Indonesia?

204
00:17:18,617 --> 00:17:21,717
Betul.
That's right.

205
00:17:20,717 --> 00:17:25,617
Aku setuju juga. Aku merasakan empati...
I agree too. I feel empathy...

206
00:17:25,617 --> 00:17:29,717
...terhadap adik saya Zeta. Iya empati iya iya.
...towards my little sister Zeta. Yes, empathy, yeah yeah.

207
00:17:29,717 --> 00:17:31,717
Kalau Kaela gimana Kaela Kovalskia?
What about Kaela? Kaela Kovalskia?

208
00:17:31,717 --> 00:17:43,617
Aku juga waktu itu enggak nyangka banget kayak, "Hah? Beneran? Ini really?" gitu kan. Kayak, "Loh, bisa gitu? Akhirnya, mana udah bersembilan di Indonesia pula," ya kan. Keren banget!
I couldn't believe it back then either, like, "Huh? Really? Is this real?" Like, "Woah, really? Finally, all nine of us in Indonesia!" Right? So cool!

209
00:17:43,617 --> 00:17:46,717
Keren banget! Keren banget! Iya.
So cool! So cool! Yeah!

210
00:17:46,717 --> 00:17:51,617
Ini kan konser pertama hololive Indonesia yang bersembilan.
This is hololive Indonesia's first concert with all nine members.

211
00:17:51,617 --> 00:18:02,617
Sebenernya tuh enggak hanya ini tuh momen terbesar dan terpenting juga untuk fans hololive Indonesia, tapi seluruh dunia juga pasti bakal nonton enggak sih?
Actually, this isn't just the biggest and most important moment for hololive Indonesia fans, but people all over the world will watch it too, right?

212
00:18:02,617 --> 00:18:07,717
Ya enggak? Jawab!
Right? Answer us!

213
00:18:07,717 --> 00:18:15,717
Iya iya, makasih makasih semuanya. Wait, tapi tentu aja ini pencapaiannya enggak bakal cuma sampai di sini aja kan?
Yeah, thank you everyone. But wait, of course this achievement won't just stop here, right?

214
00:18:15,717 --> 00:18:21,717
Jadi, next-nya mungkin kita bisa apa ya... dominating the world! Gitu, we are ready! Ready ready ready!
So next, maybe we can... dominating the world! Like that! We are ready!

215
00:18:21,717 --> 00:18:25,617
Ready ready ready! Betul banget! Kaela! Zeta!
Ready, ready, ready! Absolutely! Kaela! Zeta!

216
00:18:25,617 --> 00:18:30,717
Selain dari dukungan fans in this opportunity, kita juga mau mengucapkan terima kasih...
Besides fan support in this opportunity, we also want to express our gratitude...

217
00:18:30,717 --> 00:18:36,617
...untuk semua sponsor yang mendukung terjadinya konser ini! Terima kasih!
...to all sponsors who supported making this concert happen! Thank you!

218
00:18:36,617 --> 00:18:43,617
Makasih! Makasih semuanya!
Thank you! Thank you everyone!

219
00:18:43,617 --> 00:18:51,617
Eh, tapi ngomong-ngomong di konser ini kayaknya ada yang beda enggak sih? Ela, kamu nyadar enggak? Soalnya kamu paling peka enggak sih?
By the way, doesn't something look different in this concert? Ela, did you notice? You're the most sensitive one, right?

220
00:18:51,617 --> 00:18:58,617
Wets! Ya sadarlah! Kalau Kobo mah enggak bakal sadar.
Woah! Of course I noticed! Kobo wouldn't notice though.

221
00:18:58,617 --> 00:19:05,617
Nih nih nih nih. Yang beda tuh kali ini tuh model kita, ini model baru nih!
Look look look! What's different this time is our 3D models. These are new models!

222
00:19:05,617 --> 00:19:11,617
Ooo... Gemes banget! Lucu-lucu!
Aww, so cute! So adorable!

223
00:19:11,617 --> 00:19:21,617
Lucu lucu lucu! Kameranya dekatin ke aku! Kameranya dekatin ke aku! Kalian mau lihat keimutan Kobo nih.
So cute! Zoom in on me! Camera, zoom in on me! You guys wanna see Kobo's cuteness, right?

224
00:19:21,617 --> 00:19:29,617
Wait wait wait, eh sini sini sini, ini kamera diambil Kobo semua enggak sih? Ini ke Kael juga! Jangan Kobo doang, udah.
Wait, wait, hey! Is the camera capturing only Kobo? Put it on Kael too! Not just Kobo. Come on.

225
00:19:29,617 --> 00:19:38,617
Nggak bisa, enggak bisa! Kamera tinggal Kobo lagi! Imut kan?
No, no! The camera is back on Kobo again! Cute, right?

226
00:19:38,617 --> 00:19:48,617
Stop stop stop stop stop stop! Mulai, mulai, mulai! Semua kamera diambil! Oke oke oke.
Stop, stop, stop! It's starting! You're taking all the camera time! Okay, okay.

227
00:19:48,617 --> 00:19:57,617
Kalau gitu... Aduh, sampe kehabisan napas. Jangan berebutan di depan konser!
Alright then... Oh my, I'm out of breath. Don't fight over the camera!

228
00:19:57,617 --> 00:20:03,617
Yeah! Iya iya iya! Kaela! Zeta! Iyes!
Yeah! Yes, yes! Kaela! Zeta! Yes!

229
00:20:05,798 --> 00:20:07,098
Tapi...
But...

230
00:20:07,098 --> 00:20:08,898
tapi iya ya udah deh.
but yeah, okay then.

231
00:20:08,898 --> 00:20:12,298
Kalau enggak boleh rebutan komputer sama Zeta,
If we're not allowed to fight over the computer with Zeta,

232
00:20:12,298 --> 00:20:15,398
hm... suka-suka aja ya, kita main aja deh sama penonton.
hm... whatever then, let me play with the audience.

233
00:20:15,398 --> 00:20:20,098
Kobo pengin deh coba kita teriakin penonton karena kan tadi mereka sudah teriakin kita.
Kobo wants us to try shouting at the audience because they shouted at us earlier.

234
00:20:20,098 --> 00:20:21,298
Iya, iya, iya.
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

235
00:20:21,298 --> 00:20:24,698
Maksudnya kita teriakin untuk kita bareng penonton-penonton!
I mean, let's cheer together with the audience!

236
00:20:24,698 --> 00:20:26,798
Betul!
That's right!

237
00:20:26,798 --> 00:20:30,198
Teriaknya bareng penonton, jangan teriakin penontonnya.
Shout *with* the audience, don't shout *at* the audience.

238
00:20:30,198 --> 00:20:31,298
Iya, gitu maksudnya!
Yeah, that's what I meant!

239
00:20:31,298 --> 00:20:35,598
Soalnya kan habis ini kita harus nyanyi, jadi kita harus simpan suara dulu gak sih?
Because after this we have to sing, so shouldn't we save our voices first?

240
00:20:35,798 --> 00:20:36,798
Betul ya.
True.

241
00:20:36,798 --> 00:20:42,398
Tenang aja gak bakal selama durasi stream Kaela gitu ya guys ya.
Don't worry, it won't be as long as Kaela's stream duration, right guys?

242
00:20:42,398 --> 00:20:49,498
Ya udah lah mau trek-trek ya udah, aku gak masalah dah, aku ngikut. Gimana nih semuanya? Udah siap belum?
Oh well, if you want to shout, go ahead, I don't mind. How about it everyone? Are you ready?

243
00:20:49,498 --> 00:20:52,598
Siap gak?
Are you ready?

244
00:20:52,598 --> 00:20:55,898
Siap nih kayaknya. Oke!
Looks like they're ready. Okay!

245
00:20:55,898 --> 00:20:57,298
Kobo dulu ya!
Kobo first, okay!

246
00:20:57,298 --> 00:20:59,798
Aku mau kita sama-sama teriak...
I want us to shout together...

247
00:20:59,798 --> 00:21:02,798
Baka, baka, baka!

248
00:21:02,798 --> 00:21:04,498
Oke, siap ya!
Okay, ready!

249
00:21:04,498 --> 00:21:08,598
Satu, dua, tiga!
One, two, three!

250
00:21:08,598 --> 00:21:13,498
Baka, baka, baka!

251
00:21:15,298 --> 00:21:18,098
Suka, suka! Giliran Zeta, giliran Zeta!
Love it, love it! Zeta's turn, Zeta's turn!

252
00:21:18,098 --> 00:21:23,798
Oke oke oke. Pas aku bilang "Mission: Start", kalian bareng-bareng teriak "Start" ya.
Okay okay okay. When I say "Mission: Start", you all shout "Start" together, okay?

253
00:21:23,798 --> 00:21:27,398
Siap? Ah... Mission...
Ready? Ah... Mission...

254
00:21:27,398 --> 00:21:32,298
Start!

255
00:21:32,298 --> 00:21:35,598
Oke, habis ini Kaela.
Okay, next is Kaela.

256
00:21:35,598 --> 00:21:40,598
Oke oke oke. Nah, ini ya buat semua penonton sama HoloHero juga.
Okay okay okay. Now, this is for all the audience and HoloHero too.

257
00:21:40,598 --> 00:21:45,198
Kalau misalnya aku bilang "HoloHero!", kalian bilang "Hoo-hah!".
If I say "HoloHero!", you say "Hoo-hah!".

258
00:21:45,198 --> 00:21:49,698
Gampang kan? Langsung langsung langsung.
Easy, right? Right away, right away!

259
00:21:49,698 --> 00:21:51,098
Oke ya, siap ya.
Okay, ready?

260
00:21:51,098 --> 00:21:51,798
HoloHero!

261
00:21:51,798 --> 00:21:54,798
Hoo-hah!

262
00:21:54,798 --> 00:21:58,798
Mantap, mantap!
Awesome, awesome!

263
00:21:58,798 --> 00:22:02,798
Keren, keren, keren. Akhirnya GEN3 kompak juga.
Cool, cool, cool. Finally, Gen 3 is synced up too!

264
00:22:02,798 --> 00:22:07,098
Iya, kompak. Kelihatannya masih pada semangat nih ya.
Yeah, synced up. Looks like everyone's still full of energy!

265
00:22:07,098 --> 00:22:11,298
Soalnya dari lagu pertama kita hari ini aja udah kerasa banget.
Because even from our first song today, the energy was amazing.

266
00:22:11,298 --> 00:22:16,298
Kalian tuh pada nyangka gak sih kalau lagu pertama kita tuh bakal 100%?
Did you guys expect that our first song would be 100%?

267
00:22:16,298 --> 00:22:20,398
Beh, mana ada yang nyangka. Aku aja sendiri gak nyangka juga.
Man, who would've guessed? Even I didn't expect it myself.

268
00:22:20,398 --> 00:22:24,798
Langsung dibuka dengan Hoshinova mode gitu, keren banget kan?
Opening right away in Hoshinova mode, super cool right?

269
00:22:24,798 --> 00:22:27,598
Keren banget sih!
Super cool!

270
00:22:27,598 --> 00:22:33,498
Keren banget sih, apalagi tadi Zeta sama Kaela nyanyi 100% tuh udah kayak real...
Super cool, especially earlier when Zeta and Kaela sang 100%, it felt like a real...

271
00:22:33,498 --> 00:22:37,298
100%, ya. Itu tuh bisa gak sih...
100%, yeah. Could it be...

272
00:22:37,298 --> 00:22:42,298
Gak sekeren tadi, aku tuh jadi ingin kayak... Kalian pernah kayak...
...not be that cool? It made me go like... Have you ever...

273
00:22:42,298 --> 00:22:44,998
Kalian pernah gak sih nyanyi lagu sekeren tadi...
Have you ever sung a song as cool as that...

274
00:22:44,998 --> 00:22:46,598
Aura farming-nya?
Aura farming?

275
00:22:46,598 --> 00:22:51,098
Aura farming-nya sebetulnya keren banget, emang lagunya Moona.
The aura farming was actually super cool, it's Moona's song after all.

276
00:22:51,098 --> 00:22:55,798
Emang kan Zeta kan soalnya biasanya lagu-lagu yang stylish, yang J-pop J-pop gitu.
Right, because Zeta usually sings stylish songs, like J-pop stuff.

277
00:22:55,798 --> 00:23:01,398
Jadi tadi pas dinyanyiin tuh ya, 100%, rasanya jadi beda banget vibes-nya.
So when 100% was sung earlier, the vibes felt totally different.

278
00:23:01,398 --> 00:23:06,398
Terus Kaela juga, tadi nge-rap yang "Su-tata tata tata", kayak apa tuh...
And Kaela too, rapping that "su-tata tata tata", like what was that...

279
00:23:06,398 --> 00:23:09,298
Tata tata tata tata...

280
00:23:09,298 --> 00:23:12,598
Iya, pokoknya keren banget!
Yeah, anyway it was so cool!

281
00:23:12,598 --> 00:23:14,598
Keren banget ya tadi.
That was super cool earlier.

282
00:23:14,598 --> 00:23:19,398
Tapi habis ini tuh masih ada lagi... "NEW ZOMBIE"!
But after this, there's still more... "NEW ZOMBIE"!

283
00:23:19,398 --> 00:23:21,798
Ayo, pada tahu dong ini lagunya siapa?
Come on, you guys know whose song this is, right?

284
00:23:21,798 --> 00:23:26,298
Tahu lah, tahu lah, senpai kita, senpai kita.
Of course, of course, our senpai, our senpai.

285
00:23:26,298 --> 00:23:32,298
Tadi tuh itu ya, Holoro tuh perform-nya juga keren banget, kayak lagi di game gitu.
Earlier, Holoro's performance was super cool too, like being inside a game.

286
00:23:32,298 --> 00:23:38,198
Betul, setuju! Terus tadi ada backdancer-nya main... keren ya guys! Keren gak?
True, agreed! And earlier the backup dancers were... cool right guys? Isn't it cool?

287
00:23:38,198 --> 00:23:43,598
Betul! Ada apa lagi tuh tadi? Lampu laser, terus ada efek kembang api segala.
Right! What else was there? Laser lights, and fireworks effects too.

288
00:23:43,598 --> 00:23:48,298
Terus banyak lah ya gimmick-gimmick yang wow. Tu backdancer nanti aku hire semua ya buat konser solo aku.
And so many wow gimmicks. I'll hire all those backup dancers for my solo concert later.

289
00:23:48,298 --> 00:23:54,098
Wah, udah ngomong konser solo aja.
Wow, already talking about a solo concert.

290
00:23:54,098 --> 00:23:57,798
Ya anggaplah doa ya.
Well, take it as a prayer.

291
00:23:57,798 --> 00:24:03,798
Tapi konser yang ini belum selesai! Belum, belum, belum!
But *this* concert isn't over yet! Not yet, not yet, not yet!

292
00:24:03,798 --> 00:24:10,998
Eh, tapi... kalian tahu gak sih sebelum ini tuh nyanyinya lagu apa?
Eh, but... do you guys know what song was sung before this?

293
00:24:10,998 --> 00:24:16,798
Eh, aku mah tahu banget lah. Itu lagu terbaru aku. Dahlah.
Eh, of course I know. That's my newest song. "Dah lah".

294
00:24:16,798 --> 00:24:22,598
Ya... udah lah? Gak usah dibahas? Dah lah...
Yeah... "udah lah" (forget it)? No need to discuss? Oh well...

295
00:24:22,598 --> 00:24:27,798
Lho, kok gitu? Itu tuh maksudnya judulnya "Dallah", lagunya judulnya "Dallah"!
Wait, why like that? That means the title is "Dallah", the song's title is "Dallah"!

296
00:24:27,798 --> 00:24:35,598
Oh! Iya, iya... Oh, Dallah!
Oh! Right, right... Oh, Dallah!

297
00:24:35,598 --> 00:24:42,298
Bilang dong! Iya, habisnya kamu kan sering "dah lah, dah lah" gitu. Jadi dikira emang beneran "dah lah".
You should've said so! Well, because you often say "oh well, oh well", so we thought it really meant "whatever".

298
00:24:42,298 --> 00:24:46,798
Entar "dalah, dalah", pulang dia.
Later if you say "dalah, dalah", she'll go home.

299
00:24:46,798 --> 00:24:49,398
Kalau gitu "Dallah" tuh maksudnya apa sih?
If so, what does "Dallah" mean anyway?

300
00:24:49,398 --> 00:24:57,298
"Dallah" sama kehidupan. Hidup tuh berat ya guys, ya. Kalau hidup berat ya udah "Dallah" aja, habis itu lanjutkan hidupmu, begitu.
"Dallah" with life. Life is tough, guys. If life is tough, just say "Dallah", then carry on with your life, like that.

301
00:24:57,298 --> 00:24:59,798
Iya betul, teman-teman. Di kehidupan yang dewasa ini ya...
Yeah right, everyone. In this adult life...

302
00:25:01,473 --> 00:25:04,273
Untung lagu-lagunya santai, easy listening.
Fortunately, the songs were chill and easy listening.

303
00:25:04,273 --> 00:25:07,573
Jadi kita sambil keliling-keliling kan, nyapa fans kita ya?
So we could walk around while greeting our fans, right?

304
00:25:07,573 --> 00:25:11,873
Asyik banget ya tadi ya? Aku juga suka banget tadi dance bagian chorus-nya ya.
That was so fun, right? I also really liked the dance during the chorus!

305
00:25:12,373 --> 00:25:14,673
Da-la, da-la, da-la, da-la...

306
00:25:14,673 --> 00:25:16,373
Itu beda lagu nggak, sih?
Isn't that a different song?

307
00:25:16,373 --> 00:25:17,873
Da-la, da-la, da-la...

308
00:25:17,873 --> 00:25:20,673
Nggak gitu deh. Nggak gitu kayaknya.
It wasn't like that. I don't think it was like that.

309
00:25:20,873 --> 00:25:23,173
Iya, tapi pokoknya asyik lah ya kalau nyanyi...
Yeah, but anyway, it's fun singing...

310
00:25:23,173 --> 00:25:26,373
...lagu chill, santai-santai kayak gini.
...chill, relaxed songs like this.

311
00:25:27,373 --> 00:25:29,673
Iya, santai dong.
Yeah, relaxed of course.

312
00:25:29,673 --> 00:25:33,673
Tapi ngomong-ngomong soal santai, kita tuh sebenarnya belum bisa santai dulu.
But talking about being relaxed, we actually can't relax just yet.

313
00:25:33,673 --> 00:25:35,873
Hei, santai!
Hey, relax!

314
00:25:35,873 --> 00:25:39,073
Karena katanya nggak boleh santai, terus...
Because they said we shouldn't relax, and...

315
00:25:39,073 --> 00:25:42,673
Iya, jangan terlalu santai. Jangan terlalu santai.
Yeah, don't be too relaxed. Don't be too relaxed.

316
00:25:42,673 --> 00:25:46,473
Karena konsernya tuh masih panjang!
